#====================================================================
# Draft knowledge entry — OHOS 运行期 open_memstream 缺陷导致依赖
# memstream 的上游测试（Qt Test tojson 类）输出为空/失败
# Source package: tinycbor/0.6.0 (task tinycbor-0.6.0-r03-pc5-3-20260906T073901Z)
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-ohos-open-memstream-runtime-defect
trigger_tool:           open_memstream|qmake|make check|conan install
phase:                  testing|runtime
error_signature:        fclose.*-9|fclose.*EBADF|open_memstream.*empty|Signal 5|core dumped|decoded stream empty|CborErrorInternalError|internal error

severity:               2
category:               testing|runtime|libc|ohos
match_keywords:         open_memstream, memstream, fclose, EBADF, SIGTRAP, core dumped, tojson, decoded empty, Qt Test, qmake, make check, internal error, OHOS, libc, printf, stream

title:                  OHOS runtime open_memstream is broken -> memstream-based upstream tests fail with empty output (environment defect, not library)

root_cause:             >
    On the OHOS aarch64 runtime (SDK 26.0.0.18 sysroot/musl-based), the libc
    open_memstream() allocates a stream but fclose() returns -9/EBADF and the
    in-memory buffer stays empty; the process may die with Signal 5 (SIGTRAP,
    exit 133). Any upstream test helper that converts via open_memstream (e.g.
    tinycbor tests/tojson parseOne(), and cbortojson.c convert_json_value which
    checks `fclose(memstream) < 0 || *key == NULL` -> CborErrorInternalError)
    therefore produces an empty decoded buffer and fails every QCOMPARE, while
    the library itself is fine (parser/encoder using the same libtinycbor.a pass
    100%). This is a runtime/libc defect, NOT a library or recipe failure.
    A minimal pure-libc repro (open_memstream -> fprintf -> fclose) reproduces
    fclose_rc=-9, size=0, buf='' and SIGTRAP without linking any library code.

affected_scope:         C/C++ libraries whose upstream tests or conversion
                        helpers use open_memstream/fmemopen-style streaming on
                        OHOS; detected when Qt Test (or any) suite shows
                        "decoded empty / compared values not the same / internal
                        error" while the same library passes other test suites.

verification_cmd:       "open_memstream(&buf,&size); fprintf(f,\"x\"); rc=fclose(f); printf(\"%d %zu '%s'\",rc,size,buf)"

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           classify-runtime-vs-library-and-record-recovery
rec_description:        >
    1) Reproduce open_memstream standalone with pure libc (no library code) to
    prove the defect is in the runtime, not the library; 2) keep the honest
    dual-caliber ledger: configured_executable_total includes all 54 slots,
    report 42/54 pass and 12/54 fail with root cause = open_memstream runtime
    defect + recovery condition (SDK fix, or rewrite the test helper with a
    non-memstream streaming callback without touching upstream sources);
    3) do NOT downgrade to "tests cannot run" (0/54) and do NOT mark the slots
    as library failures; 4) verify binary availability with
    `conan install --requires=<pkg> --build=never` + conan graph info, never
    with `conan list` or `conan download --only-recipe` alone.
rec_command:            'conan install --requires=qt/5.15.19 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --build=never; qmake -o Makefile tests.pro && make -C tests && ./tojson'
rec_auto_fix:           false

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      non-memstream-stream-callback
fallback_description:   >
    If a test helper must use streaming conversion and open_memstream is broken,
    provide a non-memstream output path (e.g. direct buffer callback) in the
    consumer/harness layer; do not patch upstream sources unless authorized.
fallback_command:       ''
fallback_auto_fix:      false

forbid_1_pattern:       'qt/5\.15\.19.*未发布|0/54|hard-block.*qt'
forbid_1_reason:        "R03 实测 qt/5.15.19 OHOS armv8 二进制存在（conan install --build=never 成功），不得保留未验证的'Qt 未发布/0/54'结论"
forbid_1_consequence:   "未经验证结论导致台账失真，质量返工"

forbid_2_pattern:       'open_memstream.*library bug|库缺陷'
forbid_2_reason:        "parser/encoder 同库 100% 通过 + 纯 libc 最小复现证明为运行环境缺陷"
forbid_2_consequence:   "错误归因会把环境缺陷误报为库缺陷"